WEBVTT

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.250
Yusha!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.250
Yu-chan!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.250
Yusha-san!

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.860
That is the power of a Hero?

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.210
Demon Lord!

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.870
Splendid.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.740
If you would wield that power for me,

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.460
I could grant you half the world, Hero.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:31.020
I don't need it!

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.970
All I want is a world 
where everyone can smile!

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.600
I knew you'd say that, Yusha.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.980
Then let's end this quickly.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.850
Let's eat yummy things and smile together!

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:46.460
Everyone...

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.610
Yeah!

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:50.550
Me first!

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.850
Holy Break!

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.930
Insolence!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.440
Pounding Knuckle!

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.280
I think not!

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.450
I'll show you the abyss of Cartado!

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:13.830
Single, Double, Triple, Quadruple, Quintuple...

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.120
Judgment Strike!

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:20.870
Weak!

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:23.710
Hero?!

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:38.530
Don't think you can bury me that easily,
 even with the Hero's sword!

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:39.890
No way...

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:41.370
So this is the Demon Lord.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.680
He's too strong.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.000
Everyone!

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.120
Lend me your power!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.450
You're using the forbidden magic?!

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.880
But if you fail...

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:53.880
Don't worry!

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.450
Have faith in me!

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.010
And in yourselves!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.730
O Holy Spirits filling the border
 between Heaven and Earth,

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:11.730
though young, we honor you
 and beseech the guardians of order,

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.420
open... open...

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.860
the prison of time beyond this world!

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:22.870
On the name of the Hero,
 Yulia Chardiet, our hearts are one!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.240
Our hearts are one!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.940
You will not succeed, Hero!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.380
Dimensional Prison Barrier, open!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.150
Begone to the ends of our
dimension, Demon Lord!

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.530
Curse you!

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:58.150
Curse you, Hero!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.280
Hero!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.480
We...

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.290
We did it!

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:15.940
We did it, Yusha!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.820
That was a huge victory!

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.130
Way to go, Hero!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.140
It wasn't just me.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.290
It was because I had all of you with me.

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.070
Let's go home. Everyone's waiting for us.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.280
Yusha, wake up. It's morning.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.110
Num, num...

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.410
I can't sleep any more.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.730
What an odd thing to mutter in your sleep.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:17.290
Seira (Ellenoar Seiran) Class: Priest

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:17.290
Jeez! Do you want to be late 
right after starting school?

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.950
Let me sleep just five more years...

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:21.900
Five years?!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.870
I thought you couldn't sleep any more!

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.660
Morning, Seira-chan.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.560
I'm going to go wake Fai and Mei.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.430
You get changed and wash your face.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.540
Got it?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.350
Yes.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.990
Yusha (Yulia Chardiet) Class: ?

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:48.990
Yeah, morning, Chibi-chan!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.850
Fai (Fai Fai) Class: Warrior

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.850
Sorry, Sei-chan!

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:14.520
I'm always starving when I first wake up.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.240
Huh?

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.400
The tips of your ears look kind of red.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.240
I-It's nothing!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.360
Your face is red, too.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:32.120
Mei (Mather Enderstto) Class: Mage

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.120
Did it taste good, Fai-san?

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.230
Well...

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:40.360
Wake up already, Fai!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.960
It was soft and spongy!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.590
Did Sei-chan wake you up too, Mei-chan?

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.540
I didn't sleep in the first place.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.970
Huh? Why?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:00.660
Mei was up all night studying Cartado.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:01.610
Cartado?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:05.120
Cartado is truly the epitome 
of the world's mysteries

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.910
and without a doubt the culmination 
of mankind's wisdom.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.060
Though the power within 
each card is limited,

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.960
by combining cards, 
you can call forth effects

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:17.160
that surpass the imagination 
and lead to infinite possibilities.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.780
For example, the combination 
I created last night

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.000
Okay, okay. Let's get moving.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.000
is capable of sealing a dragon
 before wounding it!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:26.230
You're always looking out
 for us in the end, Seira-chan.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.470
You're like our mom!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.760
I'm not that old yet!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:36.790
Adventurer School

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:43.720
Uh, I have an important 
announcement to make.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:49.560
I'm going to live in the countryside 
with my grandchild's family,

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.340
so today is my last day teaching here.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.820
That's too sudden!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:58.370
Well, your new teacher's already 
been chosen, so don't worry.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.740
Farewell!

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:02.210
Teleport!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.630
Wha...

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:12.820
He's honed his use of Cartado. 
What an impressive teacher.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.520
He's not our teacher anymore, though.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.960
I wonder what our new teacher will be like!

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:28.930
I...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.780
am...

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.120
your...

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:33.620
new...

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:35.380
teach—

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.060
Argh, you're in the way!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.540
Starting today, I'm your 
new teacher, the Dem—

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.370
Mao!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.250
I'm going to whip you all into shape,
 so prepare yourselves!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.500
So cute!

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:52.470
Mao-chan-sensei, huh? How cute!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.850
I don't think you should address 
a teacher with "-chan."

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.800
She <i>is</i> cute, though.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.700
I know!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.020
Cute!

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.170
Behind me?!

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.650
So cute!

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:13.590
Cute, cute, cute!

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.160
What are you doing to the teacher, Yusha?!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.650
The Hero?!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.650
But she's so cute!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:25.420
Yulia Chardiet...

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:29.920
Yeah! You can call me Yusha, Mao-chan!

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:37.360
Here on Naral Island, anything 
is possible. It's a magical island.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:41.240
Because of that, there's plenty 
of unexpected trouble, as well.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:45.080
Normally, the Royal Military 
would handle problems,

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:48.310
Lapanesta Kingdom, Lapanesta Castle

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.780
but the truth is that they 
can't keep up with them.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:54.020
So that's why the land needs adventurers. 
Jacks of all trades, basically.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.570
That was blunt.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.180
This adventurer school exists 
to raise your skills.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:05.210
But it's important for adventurers to learn 
skills appropriate to their Classes.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.060
Now, you four!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.960
What are your Classes?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:12.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:19.720
The Seiran family is a line of Priests,
 and I, too, am a healing Priest.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:23.100
I'm a Warrior! I hit things a lot!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.310
I'd like to try being someone who 
sexes baby birds, just once...

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.350
She's a Mage!

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:30.880
I'm...

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.730
I'm a Hero, of course!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.120
A Hero?

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.860
Did she say a Hero?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:41.240
Hmm? Did I say something strange?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.980
Don't you understand?

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:45.650
A Hero exists only when there's a Demon Lord.

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:50.130
There are plenty of monsters on the island, 
but there's no Demon Lord in this day and age.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:55.130
Therefore, you are currently Classless!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:11:01.010
Classless?!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.180
Yusha (Yulia Chardiet) Class:?

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.010
Yusha (Yulia Chardiet) Class: Classless

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.390
So the first thing I need to do is find 
a Demon Lord living in this age, right?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:09.520
Then I can become a Hero, right?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.570
This may be abrupt, but tomorrow,

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.450
our adventuring class will
be held in the nearby ruins!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.520
What?!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.330
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.500
Nearby Ruins

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.910
I can't wait! It's our 
first practical adventure!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:39.000
I know!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.260
Hey, you two, settle down.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:45.030
Now, it's time to begin
 your practical adventure!

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:45.640
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.460
Worry not.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.800
It's just a simple task of going in and getting

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:52.650
the items I've already placed
 deep within the ruins.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.940
Nice! So this'll be easy!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:12:00.320
By the way, those who fail this 
practical class will be expelled!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.480
What?!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.030
E-Expelled?!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:10.460
These ruins contain only the weakest 
monsters, and there are no lethal traps.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:14.620
If you can't clear these ruins, then frankly, 
you're not fit to be an adventurer.

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.630
Now, first party, get going.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.080
Y-Yeah!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.140
Here we go!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.740
That was easy.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.830
The traps weren't that bad, either.

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.940
No sweat at all.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.410
Piece of cake.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.360
It seems like it really is an easy task.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.320
Go on. You're the final party.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.200
Okay!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:49.330
By the way, why did the 
four of you become a party?

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.100
Because our seats were close in class?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.580
Because we shared a table in the cafeteria?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.280
Because our dorm rooms 
are next to each other?

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.780
No, it was destiny!

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:04.850
Because we faced the super inhumane 
spell developed by the Demon Lord—

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.930
"Okay, form a group of four!"—

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.720
head-on, and we beat it by 
coming together as a party!

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.600
I don't recall ever developing that.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.720
Huh? Did you say something?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.020
You just imagined it.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.430
More importantly, you should get going.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.030
Right.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.320
Okay, everyone...

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.570
Let's go, everyone!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.180
This is our first step 
toward becoming Heroes!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.160
Yeah!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:31.660
The way you naturally steal the spotlight 
definitely shows your knack as a Hero.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.360
Are you really hoping to become a Hero?

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:38.600
Yeah!

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.050
I see.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>In that case, your destiny 
ends here, Yulia Chardiet!</i>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:50.310
<i>I, the Demon Lord, will not allow 
you to become a Hero again!</i>

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:58.280
I thought I heard Mao-sensei start 
cackling, but she's just coughing!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:00.230
That's so cute of her, too!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:04.940
<i>That final battle with the Hero's party...</i>

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:09.120
<i>That was both the end of everything 
and a new beginning.</i>

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.470
<i>I am the Demon Lord.</i>

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:15.120
<i>The Demon Lord who once 
tried to rule the world</i>

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:19.630
<i>and fought the party of heroes 
led by the Hero, Yulia Chardiet.</i>

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:24.110
<i>During that battle,
 the Hero used forbidden magic.</i>

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.380
<i>And it was a huge failure!</i>

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.320
<i>The spell went berserk, 
and I was caught up in it.</i>

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.000
<i>I thought I was a goner!</i>

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.300
<i>But that didn't happen.</i>

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:42.420
<i>The rampaging spell 
actually turned back time!</i>

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:45.390
<i>This world I'm in now is...</i>

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:49.700
<i>yes, the time before the hero became a Hero!</i>

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:54.350
<i>Fortunately, I've still retained 
my memories from before.</i>

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:58.270
<i>Now I've managed to slip into this 
adventurer school as a teacher,</i>

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:01.950
<i>and I'm determined to stop 
the hero from becoming a Hero!</i>

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.220
<i>Heroes...</i>

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:10.040
<i>You're destined for expulsion!</i>

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.610
<i>I won't take your lives.</i>

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:15.080
<i>You can enjoy living in shame!</i>

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.500
Let's go, everyone!

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:34.810
Hah!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.190
Bam!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.700
Yep.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.440
Heave-ho!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:41.500
Why are you using a club?!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.750
Because I'm Classless.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.300
Oh, sorry.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:48.370
I'll do my best, though!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.630
Off to adventure!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.270
Why the sudden stop?

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.520
The path diverges.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:03.770
An arrow.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.940
How kind!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.000
It's just like Mao-chan said!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.760
This way, this way!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.020
Is it really all right?

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:15.700
Seira-chan, hurry up!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.290
Coming!

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:53.660
Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.510
Man, we've been trapped good.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.330
They sure got us.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.790
There's more to ancient ruins than I expected.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.940
No, we clearly left the ruins a while ago!

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:10.800
We're going to be expelled from adventurer 
school for failing the first practical!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.930
What am I supposed to tell my family?!

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.300
Seira-chan, don't cry!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.980
Tears are nutrition for the heart. 
They'll make Sei-chan stronger!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:20.110
Grandma!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:25.060
We should at least do what we can to 
make sure those tears aren't wasted.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.450
Cartado of fortune telling,

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:30.280
may your revelations guide us!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.070
Fortune!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.430
Seira-san, I know what we need to do.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:39.450
Really?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:40.820
Yes.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:44.460
It's going to rain tomorrow,
so we must not forget our umbrellas.

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:47.080
That's a weather report!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:51.580
Oh, darn it! We're all going to be expelled!

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:55.720
Oh, come on. Everything 
will be fine, Seira-chan.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:59.530
How can you say that?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:02.220
Hero

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.220
My Hero's intuition!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:06.050
Yusha, aren't you... Classless?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.560
But I do have a Hero's intuition!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.010
See? This spot looks suspicious!

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:20.090
See?

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.080
Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.840
I've had enough...

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.530
What's the matter, Yu-chan?

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:45.350
I thought I just heard someone calling me.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:53.900
It looks like a sword.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:57.510
Are you the one that called to me?

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:03.020
This is that thing that 
happens often, isn't it?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.040
Where the one to draw the 
sword becomes the Hero...

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.310
That's written right here.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:12.130
B-But this might be some kind of trap.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.140
I drew it!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.050
Don't draw it!

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:19.620
What are you going to do if it's cursed?!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.480
It's much lighter than a club!

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:22.680
Listen!

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:25.860
Just get down from there right now!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:28.780
"The one who draws the Hero's sword
 shall be faced with trials," it says.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.020
It's such an amazing sword!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.560
You did it, Yu-chan!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:29.560
Which means...

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.940
The first trial's starting now.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.130
Wh-What?!

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.420
A golem?!

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:44.080
Everyone, get back!

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:51.510
Yusha!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:52.830
Yu-chan!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:52.830
Yusha-san!

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:03.470
What? This is incredible!

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.830
Fai, you're up!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.260
Leave it to me!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:16.110
Grant this one great strength: Power!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.440
Kerpunch!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.980
Stone Bind!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:34.960
Yusha!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:34.960
Yu-chan!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:34.960
Yusha-san!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:38.900
Yeah! I'll finish it off!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.470
We did it!

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.320
They're not coming back.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.230
This means expulsion.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.540
Seriously?

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.650
They're really being expelled?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:02.650
What could've happened?

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.240
<i>Now there won't be a Hero.</i>

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.910
<i>I'll be able to fulfill my ambition!</i>

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.540
What?! That light...

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:27.980
I thought I was done for.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:30.260
You went way overboard, Yusha.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.100
I'm sorry!

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.500
Oh, Mao-chan!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.160
We didn't find your clear item, but...

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:43.820
Ta-da!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:47.570
Instead, we found the Hero's sword!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.370
The Hero's sword?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.200
The real one?

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.330
What's going on?

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.200
N-No way...

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:58.080
I managed to become a Hero!

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.130
Yusha (Yulia Chardiet) Class: Classless

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.960
Yusha (Yulia Chardiet) Class: Hero

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:04.970
Roll 1

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Demon Lord, Vanish into the Sunset!

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:38.980
"Demon Lord, Vanish into the Sunset!"
